               "opportunityCheck":  "The page\u0027s sub-scores look broadly reasonable but slightly dated on AI revenue exposure and bottleneck power. With Google Cloud doubling to $30.7 billion—nearly a quarter of Q3 2026 revenue—on AI infrastructure and external TPU sales, plus a $560.8 billion backlog, I would raise AI revenue exposure. Bottleneck and pricing power also deserves a modest upward look given 36.2% Cloud margins and custom TPU 8tx/8i Max differentiation, though lower initial AI Mode ad monetization and $195B–$205B annual capex prevent a big upgrade. Market growth, position, and optionality still fit well.",
